#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:389
msgid "AI 提供商"
msgstr "AI Provider"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:403
msgid "选择用于评论评分的 AI 提供商，仅列出已配置凭据的提供商"
msgstr ""
"The AI provider used for comment scoring. Only providers with configured "
"credentials are listed"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:411
msgid "AI 模型"
msgstr "AI Model"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:421
msgid "模型清单由页面联网向服务商读取，只列出可用于评论评分的模型；选定具体提供商后仅列出它的模型"
msgstr "The model list is fetched from the providers over the network and only lists models that can score comments. After picking a specific provider, only its models are listed."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:219
msgid "正在读取模型清单..."
msgstr "Loading model list..."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:220
msgid "模型清单读取失败，请检查网络后刷新页面重试"
msgstr "Failed to load the model list. Check the network and reload this page."

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:430
msgid "系统提示词"
msgstr "System Prompt"

