msgstr "Rate limiting"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:569
msgid "允许请求"
msgstr "allow"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:573
msgid "个字符"
msgstr "characters"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:576
msgid "按发送给 AI 的输入字符数统计（含系统提示词、评论者名称与评论内容），-1 表示无限制，0 表示暂停所有 AI 请求，配额耗尽后按检测失败处理"
msgstr "Counts input characters sent to the AI (including system prompt, commenter name and comment content); -1 means unlimited, 0 pauses all AI requests, and comments are handled as detection failures once the quota is exhausted"

#: admin/class-admin-settings.php:217
msgid "限流字符数必须是不小于 -1 的整数"
msgstr "Rate limit characters must be an integer no less than -1"

